_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ can be written as:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{x-{x}_{0}}{{v}_{x}}=\\frac{y-{y}_{0}}{{v}_{y}}=\\frac{z-{z}_{0}}{{v}_{z}} \\\\ \\frac{x-(-1)}{-2}=\\frac{y-(-1)}{-2}=\\frac{z-1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{x+1}{-2}=\\frac{y+1}{-2}=\\frac{z-1}{2} \\\\ \\frac{x+1}{1}=\\frac{y+1}{1}=\\frac{z-1}{-1} \\\\ x+1=y+1=\\frac{z-1}{-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373141 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373142 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373143 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373144 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186373145 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186373145 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373140 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "31f112b8-6ada-53ff-b6b3-be00d57b76b2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373141 #edb/ref 1080 "x-1=y+1=\\frac{z-1}{-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373141 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373141 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "fd12d1d6-f236-57c3-bd6d-b0a476bef5f3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373142 #edb/ref 1080 "x+1=y+1=\\frac{z+1}{-1}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373142 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373142 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e0818182-cafe-552e-a4a0-98b0c1314881" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373143 #edb/ref 1080 "x+1=y-1=z-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373143 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373143 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "df5c957f-327c-59b5-a275-854f61c6c1b1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373144 #edb/ref 1080 "x+1=y+1=z-1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186373144 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 